4. HOW TO EDIT & CUSTOMIZE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. Branding & Logo:
   - Replace `/frontend/public/logo.jpg` with your company logo. The app
     automatically references this image in the Navbar, Footer, Login screen,
     and Admin sidebar.
   - Adjust theme colors in `/frontend/tailwind.config.js` under the `brand` key:
     `brand.red`, `brand.black`, `brand.white`, `brand.grey`.

B. Adding & Managing Contact Channels:
   - Log into the Admin Panel at `/admin` -> "Contact Info".
   - You can add unlimited communication channels:
     * Multiple WhatsApp lines (e.g. "Main Support", "Night Dispatch")
     * Multiple Phone lines with extension numbers
     * Facebook Page URLs
     * Instagram handles or direct profile links
     * Telegram channels or direct messenger links
     * LinkedIn company pages
   - All channels instantly synchronize across the website:
     * Header & Footer
     * The Contact Page directory
     * The floating "Call Us" and "WhatsApp" quick-action widgets

C. Services, Rates & Zones:
   - Edit starting prices and service descriptions directly in `/admin/services`.
   - Update delivery zones, coverage radius, and active hubs in `/admin/areas`.
   - Update FAQs in `/admin/faqs`.

D. Input Validation Rules:
   - Any `<Input />` component in the frontend supports:
     * `numericOnly={true}`: Disallows letters and symbols entirely.
     * `phoneOnly={true}`: Only allows digits, spaces, hyphens, and leading plus sign (+).
     * `allowDecimal={true}`: Permits floating-point decimal prices.
   - Server-side validations are located in `/backend/src/validation/schemas.ts`.

