5. HOW TO RUN & TEST
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. Install Dependencies:
   npm install

B. Development Mode (Runs Frontend & Backend unified on port 3000):
   npm run dev

C. Building for Production:
   npm run build
   (Compiles the frontend with Vite into dist/public and backend into dist)

D. Running Production:
   npm start
   (Executes node server.ts serving both APIs and pre-rendered frontend)

E. Database Migrations & Reset:
   cd backend
   npx prisma migrate dev --name init
   npx prisma db seed

