7. PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT GUIDELINES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. Environment Variables (.env):
   PORT=3000
   NODE_ENV=production
   DATABASE_URL="file:./prisma/dev.db"  (or "postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/dbname")
   JWT_SECRET="generate-a-strong-random-64-character-secret"
   JWT_EXPIRES_IN="7d"
   BUSINESS_EMAIL="support@godeliver.com"
   WHATSAPP_NUMBER="+1 (800) 463-3548"

B. Docker / Container Deployment:
   - Base image: node:20-alpine
   - Expose port 3000
   - Run command: npm run build && npm start

C. Reverse Proxy (Nginx / Cloudflare):
   - Proxy all incoming requests to http://localhost:3000
   - Enable WebSocket pass-through if HMR is used during staging
   - Set X-Forwarded-For, X-Forwarded-Proto headers (Express trust proxy is enabled)

